並提供廣泛的配置選項以應對高級測試場景。","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":767},"end":{"line":20,"column":49,"offset":815}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":767},"end":{"line":20,"column":49,"offset":815}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"LiteSVM 支援 Rust、TypeScript/JavaScript 和 Python（通過 ","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":3,"offset":821},"end":{"line":22,"column":53,"offset":871}}},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"solders","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":53,"offset":871},"end":{"line":22,"column":62,"offset":880}}},{"type":"text","value":"）。","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":62,"offset":880},"end":{"line":22,"column":64,"offset":882}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":3,"offset":821},"end":{"line":22,"column":64,"offset":882}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":819},"end":{"line":22,"column":64,"offset":882}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":22,"column":64,"offset":882}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# LiteSVM 101\r\n\r\n![使用 LiteSVM 進行測試](/graphics/course-banners/testing-with-litesvm.png)\r\n\r\nSolana 程式的測試傳統上需要在速度和準確性之間作出選擇。LiteSVM 通過提供一個既快速又功能完整的內部測試環境，消除了這種取捨。\r\n\r\nLiteSVM 為 Solana 開發者提供了三大關鍵優勢：\r\n- **比 `solana-program-test` 和 `solana-test-validator` 更快的執行速度**\r\n- **直接操控帳戶狀態**，以測試複雜的邊界情況\r\n- **內建性能分析工具**，用於識別優化和改進的機會\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"什麼是 LiteSVM\" id=\"what-is-litesvm\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n[LiteSVM](https://github.com/LiteSVM/litesvm) 是一個輕量級的 Solana 虛擬機，直接在您的測試過程中運行。由 [Aursen](https://x.com/exoaursen) 和 [Exotic Markets](https://x.com/exotic_markets_) 創建，它在保持與 Solana 運行時完全兼容的同時，消除了外部驗證器的開銷。\r\n\r\n與傳統的測試方法需要啟動單獨的驗證器進程不同，LiteSVM 將虛擬機嵌入到您的測試中。這種架構在不犧牲測試準確性的情況下，顯著提高了編譯和執行速度。\r\n\r\n該庫提供了一個直觀的 API，具有智能預設以便快速設置，並提供廣泛的配置選項以應對高級測試場景。\r\n\r\n> LiteSVM 支援 Rust、TypeScript/JavaScript 和 Python（通過 `solders`）。","highlightedCode":{}}